## Architecture Note

The DeepReasoner creates **compound reasoning** — each LLM call builds on the THINKING
of the previous call, not just on raw facts. This is the key architectural difference
from the old pipeline where each component operated in isolation on the same flat fact set.

Step 1 extracts mechanisms → Step 2 stress-tests THOSE mechanisms → Step 3 finds what
the COMBINATION of tested mechanisms reveals → Step 4 projects futures from THOSE insights →
Step 5 maps the founder onto THAT landscape. Each step is richer than the last because
it has the full reasoning history of all previous steps.
